# Q1 Benchmark Analysis - Row-Row Matrix Multiplication

Source: `benchmark/results.csv`  |  process counts: 1 2 4 8  |  statistic: median over trials

`t_algo` = `t_compute` + `t_comm`, where `t_comm` = `t_dist` (Bcast dims + Scatterv A + Bcast B) + `t_gather` (Gatherv C).

### Matrix sizes

| Label | m x n x p |
|:--|:-:|
| small | 256x256x256 |
| medium | 512x512x512 |
| large | 1024x1024x1024 |
| skew_wide | 128x1024x1024 |
| uneven | 1000x999x997 |

### Runtime - median `t_algo` (seconds)

| Input size | P=1 | P=2 | P=4 | P=8 |
|:--|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|
| small | 0.0105 | 0.0113 | 0.0081 | 0.0378 |
| medium | 0.0771 | 0.0788 | 0.0457 | 0.0950 |
| large | 0.5902 | 0.3063 | 0.3137 | 0.2699 |
| skew_wide | 0.0787 | 0.0447 | 0.0526 | 0.1083 |
| uneven | 0.5462 | 0.2857 | 0.2891 | 0.2529 |

### Speed-up  S(P) = T1 / TP

