| medium | 4.7% | 7.0% | 19.8% | 80.4% |
| large | 2.1% | 5.2% | 7.6% | 45.6% |
| skew_wide | 7.5% | 18.0% | 30.2% | 83.0% |
| uneven | 2.1% | 5.2% | 7.9% | 47.2% |

